  "notes": "{痛|いた}む is an intransitive verb meaning to feel pain or ache.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: {自動詞|じどうし} (intransitive)\n- Related: {痛|いた}める (transitive, to hurt/injure)\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- {頭|あたま}が{痛|いた}む (head hurts)\n- {胃|い}が{痛|いた}む (stomach hurts)\n- {傷|きず}が{痛|いた}む (wound hurts)\n- {心|こころ}が{痛|いた}む (heart aches - figurative)\n\nDISTINCTION FROM {痛|いた}い:\n- {痛|いた}い: adjective describing pain sensation\n- {痛|いた}む: verb indicating ongoing/developing pain",
